@startuml
' Student activity sequence diagram for VibeCraft
skinparam backgroundColor #F8F3FF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #6D28D9
  LifeLineBorderColor #8B5CF6
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F5F3FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #7C3AED
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F3E8FF
  ActorBorderColor #7C3AED
  ActorBackgroundColor #EDE9FE
  BoxBorderColor #7C3AED
  BoxBackgroundColor #F8F3FF
  MessageAlign center
}

actor Student
participant Browser
participant FeedPage
participant ProfilePage
participant PortfolioPage
participant StatusPage
participant StudentsPage
participant CollaborationsPage
participant LeaderboardPage
participant EventPage
participant UserModel
participant Storage

Student -> Browser: Login and open home page
Browser -> FeedPage: Load student-only feed
FeedPage -> UserModel: Get statuses, likes, follows
UserModel --> FeedPage: Feed items
FeedPage -> Student: Show social feed

alt Student wants to post status
    Student -> StatusPage: Create new status
    StatusPage -> Storage: Upload media if provided
    Storage --> StatusPage: Media saved
    StatusPage -> UserModel: Store status
    UserModel --> StatusPage: Status created
    StatusPage -> Student: Confirmation
else Student skips posting
    StatusPage -> Student: Return to feed
end

Student -> ProfilePage: Open profile / edit profile
ProfilePage -> UserModel: Load profile and talent data
UserModel --> ProfilePage: Profile details
ProfilePage -> Student: Display editable profile

alt Student updates profile
    Student -> ProfilePage: Save changes
    ProfilePage -> UserModel: Update profile
    UserModel --> ProfilePage: Saved
else Validation fails
    ProfilePage -> Student: Show validation errors
end

Student -> PortfolioPage: Open portfolio
PortfolioPage -> UserModel: Load portfolio items
UserModel --> PortfolioPage: Portfolio list
PortfolioPage -> Student: Display media items

alt Student adds portfolio item
    Student -> PortfolioPage: Create portfolio item
    PortfolioPage -> Storage: Upload file/media
    Storage --> PortfolioPage: File stored
    PortfolioPage -> UserModel: Save item
    UserModel --> PortfolioPage: Item created
else File too large or invalid type
    PortfolioPage -> Student: Show fallback upload error
end

Student -> StudentsPage: Browse other students
StudentsPage -> UserModel: Query users and ranks
UserModel --> StudentsPage: Student directory
Student -> StudentsPage: Follow / view profile
StudentsPage -> UserModel: Save follow relationship
UserModel --> StudentsPage: Follow updated

Student -> CollaborationsPage: Open collaborations
CollaborationsPage -> UserModel: Load open collaborations
UserModel --> CollaborationsPage: Collaboration list

alt Student joins or requests collaboration
    Student -> CollaborationsPage: Send collaboration request
    CollaborationsPage -> UserModel: Create request
    UserModel --> CollaborationsPage: Request queued
else Request blocked or already exists
    CollaborationsPage -> Student: Show duplicate/fallback notice
end

Student -> LeaderboardPage: View leaderboard
LeaderboardPage -> UserModel: Get ranked students
UserModel --> LeaderboardPage: Ranked results
LeaderboardPage -> Student: Display leaderboard

Student -> EventPage: Open event list / event details
EventPage -> UserModel: Load available events
UserModel --> EventPage: Event data

alt Student RSVPs to event
    Student -> EventPage: Submit RSVP
    EventPage -> UserModel: Save event application
    UserModel --> EventPage: RSVP confirmed
else Event full or closed
    EventPage -> Student: Show fallback message
end

Student -> Browser: Open wearable glance page
Browser -> FeedPage: Load wearable data / notification summary
FeedPage -> UserModel: Fetch glance info
UserModel --> FeedPage: Summary data
FeedPage -> Student: Show glance / wearable status
@enduml
